  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/e4TeVgY.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/適用於 Minecraft-1.19-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"248\" height=\"28\">  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/安裝於-客戶端與伺服器-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horse-expert/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\"></a>  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horse-expert/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\"></a>  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\"></a>  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a>  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📖 關於：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Horse Expert</strong> 能透過顯示所有相關的馬匹統計數據，大幅幫助你挑選信賴的坐騎。但別急著用！你必須先製作並裝備單片眼鏡。接著只要看著一匹馬，就能查看它的狀況（馬匹必須已馴服，此設定可調整）。也適用於羊駝，並提供額外資訊！</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📷 媒體：</strong></span></p><table style=\"text-align:center\"><tbody><tr><td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/961/2022-08-31_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td><td>  </td><td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/962/2022-08-31_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td></tr><tr><td><strong>誰會想到你的馬竟然這麼厲害？</strong></td><td>  </td><td><strong>普通羊駝的樣子</strong></td></tr><tr><td> </td></tr><tr><td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/963/2022-08-31_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td><td>  </td><td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/964/2022-08-31_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td></tr><tr><td><strong>知識帶來風格</strong></td><td>  </td><td><strong>製作單片眼鏡道具</strong></td></tr><tr><td> </td></tr></tbody></table><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>💡 常見問題：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：我如何在 Forge 上設定這個模組？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>安裝我的 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a> 模組，即可直接在遊戲中進行設定！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：我如何在 Fabric 上設定這個模組？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>目前尚未實作在遊戲內直接編輯設定的功能。請在進入世界後，執行 <code>/config showfile &lt;modid&gt;</code> 指令，並選擇 <code>CLIENT</code> 或 <code>SERVER</code>（取決於該模組），接著點擊聊天視窗中出現的檔案名稱（副檔名為 .toml），即可在外部編輯器中手動編輯設定檔。儲存檔案後，遊戲會在幾秒後自動重新載入設定，無需重新啟動遊戲。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>🏆 鳴謝：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">《Easy Magic》的開發過程曾獲得以下協助與啟發：</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/teaj4y\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>TeaJ4y</strong></span></a>：受其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horsestatsvanilla\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Horse Stats Vanilla</span></a> 模組啟發而啟動本專案</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/ron0\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Ron0</strong></span></a>：製作精美的單片眼鏡紋理</span></li></ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&message=LunaPixelStudios&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\"></a>  <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\"></a>  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs_&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a>  <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzss&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a>  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\"></a>  <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=@Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\"></a>  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fuser%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=u/Fusseel&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=reddit&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\"></a>  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Fuzs 0212&color=ecebe6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\"><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-shulker-boxes-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vz0tBff.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td><td>  </td><td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-enchants-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MynoO6R.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td></tr><tr><td> </td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td><td>  </td><td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mU9OlhP.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td></tr><tr><td> </td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kiHP8s9.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td><td>  </td><td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tiny-skeletons-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GCYM7Zl.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td></tr><tr><td> </td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Mlxi8cy.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td><td>  </td><td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-bone-meal-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/q3CooZb.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td></tr><tr><td> </td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-age-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sHiR309.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td><td>  </td><td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/air-hop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MinxlVJ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td></tr><tr><td> </td></tr></tbody></table><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fyxvi8i.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
